From: matawaa
Subject: [PATCH] asteroid: disable timesyncd; advertise hoki BLE name

Phone BLE time sync (Gadgetbridge / AsteroidOS Sync → btsyncd →
timedated SetTime) is the clock source on hoki (RTC not writable).
systemd-timesyncd stays "NTP active" without syncing when offline, so
timedated rejects SetTime. NixOS stubs SetNTP, so disable timesyncd.

Also set networking.hostName to the upstream Asteroid codename so
Gadgetbridge can match KNOWN_DEVICE_CODENAMES ("hoki") instead of
the default "nixos" alias.

---
 devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix               |  5 +++++
 examples/asteroid/asteroid-desktop.nix        |  7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix b/devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix
--- a/devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix
+++ b/devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix
@@ -58,6 +58,11 @@ in
     manufacturer = "Fossil";
   };
 
+  # Upstream AsteroidOS advertises the short machine codename over BLE so
+  # Gadgetbridge can match KNOWN_DEVICE_CODENAMES ("hoki"). Default NixOS
+  # hostname "nixos" breaks that discovery path.
+  networking.hostName = lib.mkDefault "hoki";
+
   mobile.device.supportLevel = "supported";
 
   # Upstream meta-hoki/conf/machine/hoki.conf: MACHINE_HAS_SPEAKER = "true".
diff --git a/examples/asteroid/asteroid-desktop.nix b/examples/asteroid/asteroid-desktop.nix
--- a/examples/asteroid/asteroid-desktop.nix
+++ b/examples/asteroid/asteroid-desktop.nix
@@ -938,6 +938,13 @@ in
         });
       '';
 
+      # hoki's RTC is not writable; phone BLE time sync (Gadgetbridge /
+      # AsteroidOS Sync → btsyncd → timedated SetTime) is the clock source.
+      # systemd-timesyncd leaves NTP "active" without syncing when offline, and
+      # timedated then rejects SetTime with "Automatic time synchronization is
+      # enabled". NixOS also stubs SetNTP, so disable timesyncd instead.
+      services.timesyncd.enable = false;
+
       # AsteroidOS Bluetooth synchronization daemon (upstream user service)
       systemd.user.services.asteroid-btsyncd = {
         description = "AsteroidOS Bluetooth Sync Daemon";
